        "slc_6d0e66bf9f08a03c8cb43bd4da59643643516b7c6a8b04ec6be7b02b65966caf"
      ],
      "text": "The stated goal is to let a customer place a pizza order, verify sufficient ingredients in inventory, and confirm the order after payment."
    },
